title: "NB Sound"
abstract: >-
  Local-first desktop application for your own music library: gapless playback, automatic cataloguing,
  on-device karaoke, a private DJ that mixes sessions, an offline mashup composer and a companion mobile
  sync, with no account and no telemetry.
